Greedy Clipboard History Dialog
https://github.com/greedgoddess/greedy-clipboard-history-dialog

This project builds a GNOME Shell extension from releases of:

  Clipboard History
  Copyright 2025 Manouchehr Ghalevand
  https://github.com/M-ghalevand/gnome-shell-extension-clipboard-history
  https://extensions.gnome.org/extension/10613/clipboard-history/
  License: GPL-2.0-or-later

This repository contains none of Clipboard History's code. Each build
downloads a release and includes its files, its LICENSE and its copyright
notices unchanged, except for:

  - extension.js and prefs.js, renamed to upstream-extension.js and
    upstream-prefs.js;
  - the extension's UUID and settings schema ID, replaced in metadata.json,
    in the settings schema, and wherever the original code writes them out
    literally;
  - the settings schema, which gets this project's keys added;
  - metadata.json, which gets this project's name, description, URL and
    version name.

This project's own files (feature/, scripts/, tests/ and the scripts in the
root folder) are by greedgoddess, also under GPL-2.0-or-later.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Manouchehr Ghalevand.

The optional 1Password integration (installed only with
./install.sh --with-1password) starts the separately installed 1Password app
(https://1password.com/) by its documented command line; no 1Password code is
included. 1Password is a trademark of AgileBits Inc. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by 1Password.
